sparkfun-12640-pro-micro.fzpz
Source: https://github.com/sparkfun/Fritzing_Parts/blob/main/products/12640_sfe_pro_micro.fzpz
License: CC BY-SA 4.0 (SparkFun hardware files).

mcubench.fritzing.promicro embeds it in the sketches with two changes: pins
are male (the original's female pins do not seat in a breadboard) and the
moduleId is renamed so it does not clash with the upstream part if that is
installed.

espressif-esp-prog.fzpz
Source: https://forum.fritzing.org/t/esp-prog-fritzig-part/12944 (Peter Van Epp, 2021)
License: not stated by the author.

mcubench.fritzing.espprog embeds it with the moduleId renamed, as above.
